{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_004_03_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:3bf446d55f40d76667707ee45a401d81d9c0b5d013098243151e938f373d4c18",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5ffff23e39cb8131b51a351d9a80cacffd4583b1cbd18e1c15ab0edb3b848521",
      "text": "实的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f73abe7422f1bc87e0571cfded3dadb920cc40df1f514c95dd9bdd491b55a1a8",
      "text": "我回来了——\n呼，今天店里也好忙啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5fd3c027cc4e18c81c93ca49c7ff3281f55d1693699590d3593ac856cdf33d4b",
      "text": "啊，不过简历……今天之内得写完才行。\n这种事情就得趁热打铁嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f578b8224ae5153e25e98160f86d89a0313b53876cb4e24f37ab0d0587f5b557",
      "text": "嘿咻。那个，简历不是这本……\n找到了找到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9428ea23091910d45edd85ebd09af1abc32cd9a6410248955c35df52ff476177",
      "text": "渡边实。年龄，31岁……\n接下来是学历和经历……啊，个人优势吗。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8dae09a6ca394aa0908e47449077023cdb7c688057e3219a47a751cae873ea4a",
      "text": "喜欢偶像。……想要探求偶像——也就是被人供奉的神像——\n吸引人心的真正原因，因此自己也……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3596441991a047d4e2a5957a156a36e495d7732d135fa15bc08f745f8ff44d5a",
      "text": "……要是这么长篇大论，未免有点恶心吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:799076f1ba844ecbea4fd9c05103a81c85217b80d75f2a6f12f535ab18a1b9c1",
      "text": "还是简简单单写成喜欢偶像吧。\n不过，要是被问到的话我可要大说特说了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3a0426513cf0a98e700f598d44be09e1e4c2d68370ef132163a025c7c66ebab9",
      "text": "……嗯，这样差不多了吧？\n最后一栏，就写上我们三个人商量好的那句话吧。……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_004bei_03_1_1_004_03:1_1_004_03_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1091c7fb05bcb98f55d08bbe7b1c5437a599a6c680782861ae08bf061695b343",
      "text": "呵呵。人生还真是什么都说不准呢。\n……对吧，叔叔。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
